  Prefab: {fileID: 6625514644646704096, guid: 64784380ef34c6b4b9c460c24352565f, type: 3}
  TextFields:
  - ' Hercules and the Dragon'
  - "A-\r\nDid I ever tell you the story of Hercules and the dragon? \r\n\r\nHercules
    completed his labors, but the gods said he cheated, so they added two more. The
    ten labors became twelve. Hercules had to go to the Garden of the Hesperides\u2014an
    orchard, one of Hera\u2019s wedding presents. He was supposed to steal three
    golden apples. Not a fun task. The garden was at the very end of the world. In
    some versions, it was guarded by a dragon. \r\n\r\nI heard you\u2019ll be working
    on the dragon soon\u2014Draco, the fourth puzzle. I know you can do this, Astrid.
    We\u2019re so close! I tried writing to the Chicago Telegram about the meteor
    storm, but they needed more proof. An exact date. Not just rumors. They wouldn\u2019t
    print it. I tried to tell them\u2014the dragon is coming. We just don\u2019t
    know when. \r\n \r\nSorry, I probably sound a little crazy. I just miss you.
    I\u2019m writing from Des Moines. Only one station to go! Soon I\u2019ll be home,
    and then we can solve this mystery together. I\u2019ll meet you at World\u2019s
    End. The garden of golden apples. \r\n \r\nLove,\r\nE\r"
  StreamingVisuals:
  - VisualAssetPath: Postcards/Draco.png
    LowResAssetPath: Postcards/Draco.png
  DefaultPinnedPos: {x: -1.15, y: 0, z: 0}
  ZoomOffsetOverride: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
